#
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: DRTC Korean Patch\n"
"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "While scavenging, "
msgstr "물자를 뒤지다가, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a man covered in cardboard boxes. He says he's been stuck there "
"for days! He has a "
msgstr "은(는) 골판지 상자에 뒤덮인 남자를 만난다. 며칠째 꼼짝도 못 했다고 한다! 손이 닿지 않는 곳에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " lying on the ground outside of his reach."
msgstr "이(가) 땅에 떨어져 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Help him up"
msgstr "일으켜 준다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Steal all his supplies"
msgstr ": 물자를 전부 훔친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:170
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Choose a thief"
msgstr "도둑을 고른다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Steal his weapon"
msgstr "무기를 훔친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Should someone steal his weapon?"
msgstr "누가 그의 무기를 훔칠까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " convinces the farmers to give "
msgstr "은(는) 농부들을 설득해서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " a pitchfork!"
msgstr "에게 쇠스랑을 받아 낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " offers "
msgstr "은(는) 제공한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " services in fixing things around the farm. "
msgstr " 실력을 농장 수리에. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is so skilled that the large amount of work isn't a huge problem."
msgstr "는 워낙 솜씨가 좋아서 일이 많아도 별문제 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "There's so many broken things that "
msgstr "고장 난 게 너무 많아서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " becomes exhausted."
msgstr "는 녹초가 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The farmers refuse to give a reward after they find out everything is still "
"broken."
msgstr "다 그대로 고장 나 있는 걸 알게 된 농부들은 보상을 거부한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The farmers are grateful for the work!"
msgstr "농부들은 일해 준 걸 고마워한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" robs the peaceful farmers. They were completely caught by surprise against "
"a non-zombie threat."
msgstr "은(는) 평화로운 농부들을 턴다. 좀비가 아닌 위협에 완전히 허를 찔렸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" hauls tons of things around. There's always stuff to haul around on a farm."
" It's exhausting work, and "
msgstr "은(는) 온갖 짐을 나른다. 농장엔 늘 나를 짐이 있다. 고된 일이라, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:235
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " get"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:235
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " very tired!"
msgstr "몹시 지친다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:239
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The farmers noticed "
msgstr "농부들은 알아봤다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "'s unusual strength and gave "
msgstr "의 남다른 힘을. 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:239
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " a scythe as a gift!"
msgstr "에게 큰 낫을 선물로 줬다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" helps with tilling the fields and planting new crops. It's exhausting work,"
" and "
msgstr "은(는) 밭을 갈고 새 작물을 심는 걸 돕는다. 고된 일이라, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "'s level of fitness and gave "
msgstr "의 체력을. 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "A Trip to the Farm"
msgstr "농장 나들이"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" runs into some people that are attempting to run a small farm. They offer 8"
" food in exchange for some help."
msgstr "은(는) 작은 농장을 운영하려는 사람들을 만난다. 일손을 도와주면 식량 8을 주겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Tilling and planting"
msgstr "밭 갈고 심기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Hauling and hauling"
msgstr "짐 나르고 또 나르기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Rob the farm"
msgstr ": 농장을 턴다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Repair work"
msgstr ": 수리 작업"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:266
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:465
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:537
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "No time to help"
msgstr "도와줄 시간 없어"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:272
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Take a detour"
msgstr "우회한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " talks to the annoying representative."
msgstr "은(는) 짜증 나는 대표와 대화한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " isn't supposed to be capable of speech, so "
msgstr "는 원래 말을 못 하는 존재라서, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " mostly just licks "
msgstr "는 주로 핥기만 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "self. The dingus is really insulted by being made to talk to a "
msgstr "자신을. 바보는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ", but the guards are amused. They let "
msgstr "한테 말을 걸어야 한다는 게 몹시 모욕적이지만, 경비들은 재밌어한다. 보내 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " through!"
msgstr "을(를)!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" is full of energy! Even talking to this nonchalant idiot is no problem at "
"all. Their conversation turns into a hotly contested 'who can talk more the "
"fastest' competition, which "
msgstr ""
"는 에너지가 넘친다! 이 태평한 바보와 대화하는 것도 전혀 문제없다. 대화는 '누가 더 빨리 더 많이 말하나' 열띤 대결로 번지고, 이긴"
" 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " wins. "
msgstr ". "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is allowed to pass!"
msgstr "은(는) 통과를 허락받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " really gets along! They mostly exchange "
msgstr "는 아주 죽이 잘 맞는다! 둘은 주로 주고받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:290
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:324
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:658
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:675
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:681
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "COOL IT"
msgstr "'진정해'"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " quips with each other. For an hour. "
msgstr " 드립을 서로. 한 시간 동안. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is let through."
msgstr "은(는) 통과한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" somehow doesn't notice all the times the dingus is annoying or insulting. "
"The meeting goes well and "
msgstr "는 바보가 짜증 나게 굴거나 모욕할 때마다 어째선지 눈치를 못 챈다. 만남은 순조롭고 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is let past."
msgstr "은(는) 통과한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " manages to be very polite. After enough pointless questioning, "
msgstr "는 아주 예의 바르게 군다. 쓸데없는 질문 공세를 충분히 견딘 뒤, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is let through the barricade."
msgstr "은(는) 바리케이드를 통과한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:299
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " loses "
msgstr "는 잃는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" temper right away and knocks him out in one punch. The barricade guards are"
" impressed by this! One gives a thumbs up. They decide to let "
msgstr ""
" 이성을 즉시. 그리고 한 방에 그를 기절시킨다. 바리케이드 경비들이 감탄한다! 한 명은 엄지를 치켜든다. 어쨌든 보내 주기로 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " through, anyway."
msgstr "을(를)."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" temper right away and starts screaming. This really spooks the guards, and "
"they start shooting. "
msgstr " 이성을 즉시, 그리고 고함을 지르기 시작한다. 경비들이 기겁해서 총을 쏘기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " has to flee!"
msgstr "은(는) 도망쳐야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " manages to control "
msgstr "는 다스린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " temper! "
msgstr " 성질을! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is let through the barricade after some further annoyance."
msgstr "은(는) 조금 더 짜증을 견딘 뒤 바리케이드를 통과한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tries to control "
msgstr "는 다스리려 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" temper, but the guy is just too annoying. He runs and tells the guards to "
"not open the door. "
msgstr " 성질을. 하지만 그 녀석은 너무 짜증 난다. 그가 달려가 경비들에게 문을 열지 말라고 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " has to find a way around!"
msgstr "은(는) 돌아갈 길을 찾아야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Who should try to deal with the annoying person?"
msgstr "누가 그 짜증 나는 사람을 상대할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Cool-it Diplomacy"
msgstr "'진정해' 외교"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" is blocked by another survivor group that set up a barricade to protect themselves. They are distrusting and heavily armed.\r\n"
"\tThe person they send to talk is "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 바리케이드를 치고 지내는 다른 생존자 무리에게 막힌다. 그들은 의심이 많고 중무장했다.\r\n"
"\t대화하러 보낸 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "EXTREMELY ANNOYING"
msgstr "극도로 짜증 나는 녀석"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " He keeps saying things like "
msgstr " 그는 계속 이런 말을 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr ", "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT."
msgstr "침 튀기지 말고 말해."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Try to not lose temper"
msgstr "성질을 참아 본다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " Who should try to deal with him?"
msgstr " 누가 상대할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:335
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Take a detour"
msgstr ": 우회한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "s in a very wise and experienced way."
msgstr " 소리를 아주 현명하고 노련하게 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " exchanges advice on different topics."
msgstr "은(는) 여러 주제에 대해 조언을 주고받는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The friendly survivor is confused by the worthless advice."
msgstr "친절한 생존자는 쓸모없는 조언에 어리둥절해한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:362
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The friendly survivor is enlightened by the advice, and gives some great "
"tips of his own!"
msgstr "친절한 생존자는 조언에 깨달음을 얻고, 자기도 훌륭한 팁을 알려 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The friendly survivor appreciates it, and gives a little bit of advice to "
msgstr "친절한 생존자는 고마워하며 답례로 조언을 조금 해 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " in return."
msgstr "에게."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "s in a reassuring way."
msgstr " 소리를 위로하듯 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tries to give a pep talk."
msgstr "은(는) 격려의 말을 해 보려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The friendly survivor actually feels worse now."
msgstr "친절한 생존자는 오히려 기분이 더 나빠졌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The friendly survivor feels very optimistic after the talk, and gives an "
"inspiring speech!"
msgstr "친절한 생존자는 대화 후 아주 낙관적이 되어 감동적인 연설을 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The friendly survivor gives some reassuring words in return."
msgstr "친절한 생존자는 답례로 위로의 말을 건넨다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" easily robs the friendly person. He didn't have much, but that will teach "
"him an important lesson in trusting others."
msgstr "은(는) 친절한 사람을 손쉽게 턴다. 가진 건 별로 없었지만, 남을 믿는 것에 대한 중요한 교훈이 될 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " starts "
msgstr "은(는) 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "FARTING"
msgstr "방귀를"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" at the person, and somehow continues to do so for several minutes without "
"stopping for even a moment."
msgstr " 그 사람에게. 그리고 어째선지 몇 분 동안 한순간도 멈추지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " interrupts the friendly survivor mid-sentence, to tell him to "
msgstr "은(는) 친절한 생존자의 말을 끊고 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:396
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:443
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:503
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:400
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"He is awestruck by this. He claims that this is all according to the "
"prophesies, and that he's been holding on to a gift for the Chosen One!"
msgstr "그는 감격한다. 이 모든 게 예언대로이며, 선택받은 자를 위한 선물을 간직해 왔다고 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "He stares at "
msgstr "그는 빤히 쳐다본다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ", without speaking, until "
msgstr "을(를) 말없이. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " leaves."
msgstr "이(가) 떠날 때까지."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:409
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Like a Normal day"
msgstr "평범한 하루처럼"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" meets another person just chilling on a park bench. He seems friendly. They have a conversation, just like before the world ended.\r\n"
"\tWhat was the main topic?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 공원 벤치에서 쉬고 있는 사람을 만난다. 친절해 보인다. 세상이 끝나기 전처럼 대화를 나눈다.\r\n"
"\t주제는 뭐였을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Advice exchange"
msgstr ": 조언 교환"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Pep Talk"
msgstr ": 격려"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:415
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Giving me your stuff"
msgstr ": 네 물건 내놔"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:418
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Cooling It"
msgstr ": 진정하기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:425
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tries to treat the woman's busted leg."
msgstr "은(는) 여자의 다친 다리를 치료해 보려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:427
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:487
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " uses "
msgstr "는 발휘한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:427
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" medical expertise to quickly fix up her leg! She appreciates the help and "
"gives what she can spare!"
msgstr " 의학 전문 지식을. 금세 다리를 고쳐 준다! 그녀는 고마워하며 내줄 수 있는 걸 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:430
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " has no idea what "
msgstr "는 모른다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:430
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is doing, wastes a day, and maybe makes things a little worse."
msgstr "가 뭘 하는지. 하루를 날리고 상태를 좀 악화시킨 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:433
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" takes a day to help the woman treat her leg. She is thankful, but can't "
"spare much!"
msgstr "는 하루를 들여 여자의 다리 치료를 돕는다. 고마워하지만, 줄 건 별로 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:435
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" tries to help over the course of a day, but doesn't manage to do much. "
"Still, practice makes perfect."
msgstr "는 하루 종일 도우려 하지만 별 소득이 없다. 그래도 연습은 완벽을 만든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:441
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " starts rolling around on the cold ground."
msgstr "은(는) 차가운 땅바닥을 굴러다니기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:443
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tells the woman to "
msgstr "은(는) 여자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:447
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"She takes this as advice that she should apply cold compresses to her leg. "
"After "
msgstr "그녀는 다리에 냉찜질을 하라는 조언으로 받아들인다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:447
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " helps her with that, she offers a reward!"
msgstr "이(가) 냉찜질을 도와주자, 그녀가 보상을 내민다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:450
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "She asks "
msgstr "그녀가 묻는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:450
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "WHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU, EXACTLY?"
msgstr "너 대체 뭐가 문제야?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:450
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " before limping away in disgust."
msgstr " 그리고 질색하며 절뚝절뚝 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:456
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" easily robs the wounded woman of what little supplies she had left. Way to "
"go!"
msgstr "은(는) 다친 여자가 가진 얼마 안 되는 물자를 손쉽게 턴다. 잘~ 했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Busted Leg"
msgstr "부러진 다리"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:462
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" meets a woman limping around with a crutch. One of her legs was wounded in "
"a recent fall as she was getting away from zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 목발을 짚고 절뚝거리는 여자를 만난다. 좀비에게서 도망치다 넘어져서 다리를 다쳤다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:464
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Help her leg"
msgstr ": 다리를 치료한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:467
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " lacks any medical supplies to help her with."
msgstr "은(는) 그녀를 도울 의약품이 하나도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:468
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Leave her alone"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Tell her to COOL IT"
msgstr ": 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:474
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Steal her supplies"
msgstr ": 물자를 훔친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tries to fix the man's broken car."
msgstr "은(는) 남자의 고장 난 차를 고쳐 보려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:487
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" car knowledge to quickly repair it! He appreciates the help and gives some "
"supplies!"
msgstr " 자동차 지식으로 금세 고친다! 그는 고마워하며 물자를 좀 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:490
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " also has no idea what "
msgstr "는 역시 모른다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:490
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " is doing, and wastes a good day farting around."
msgstr "가 뭘 하는지. 하루를 그냥 빈둥대며 날린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:493
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" takes a day to help fix the man's car. He gives some supplies as a reward!"
msgstr "는 하루를 들여 남자의 차를 고친다. 보상으로 물자를 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:495
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" tries to help over the course of a day, but isn't successful. Still, it's "
"good practice."
msgstr "는 하루 종일 도우려 하지만 실패한다. 그래도 좋은 연습이었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:501
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" ignores the stranded man and starts eating ants crawling on the cold "
"ground."
msgstr "은(는) 오도 가도 못하는 남자를 무시하고 차가운 땅을 기어 다니는 개미를 먹기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:503
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tells the stranded man to "
msgstr "은(는) 오도 가도 못하는 남자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "YOU'RE RIGHT! THE CAR JUST NEEDS MORE COOLANT TO RUN AGAIN!"
msgstr "맞아! 차에 냉각수만 더 넣으면 다시 굴러가겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " He offers a reward!"
msgstr " 그가 보상을 내민다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:510
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "He starts yelling at "
msgstr "그가 고함치기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:510
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " until "
msgstr "에게. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:510
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " leave"
msgstr "이(가) 떠날 때까지"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:516
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " easily robs the stranded man of his supplies, even his wrench."
msgstr "은(는) 오도 가도 못하는 남자의 물자를 렌치까지 손쉽게 털어 간다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:521
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Helping with Car Trouble"
msgstr "차 문제 도와주기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:526
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" meets a man trying to repair his broken car. He clearly has no idea of what"
" he's doing."
msgstr "은(는) 고장 난 차를 고치려는 남자를 만난다. 뭘 하는지 전혀 모르는 게 분명하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:527
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Help fix car"
msgstr ": 차 수리를 돕는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:529
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Recruit him"
msgstr ": 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:532
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Tell him to COOL IT"
msgstr ": 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:535
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Steal his supplies"
msgstr ": 물자를 훔친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:547
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" takes a cowboy rifle from the settlers and hides in a tall place. When the "
"bandits show up, "
msgstr "은(는) 정착민들에게 카우보이 소총을 빌려 높은 곳에 숨는다. 약탈자들이 나타나자, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:547
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" makes multiple amazing shots to blow out their tires.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits become too freaked out to continue the attack! The fight is over before it starts. The settlers are glad to give the reward!"
msgstr ""
"는 놀라운 사격을 연달아 해서 놈들의 타이어를 터뜨린다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들은 겁에 질려 공격을 포기한다! 싸움은 시작도 전에 끝났다. 정착민들은 기꺼이 보상을 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:557
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The settlers remain true to their word and give a large reward!"
msgstr "정착민들은 약속을 지키고 큰 보상을 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " does some crazy shots that inspire the others."
msgstr "은(는) 미친 사격 솜씨로 다른 이들에게 영감을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:569
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " decides to help the settlers fight the bandits, directly."
msgstr "은(는) 정착민들을 도와 직접 약탈자와 싸우기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The shooting skill of the group helps the settlers overwhelm the bandits. No"
" one is hurt!"
msgstr "일행의 사격 실력 덕분에 정착민들이 약탈자들을 압도한다. 아무도 다치지 않았다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The fight is harsh, but the group's shooting abilities save the settlement."
msgstr "싸움은 치열했지만, 일행의 사격 실력이 정착지를 구한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:580
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The fight is brutal! The group's shooting skills barely help drive the "
"bandits away."
msgstr "싸움이 처참하다! 일행의 사격 실력으로 간신히 약탈자들을 몰아낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:583
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The help provided wasn't nearly enough in the shootout. The bandits drive "
"everyone from the settlement."
msgstr "총격전에서 도움이 턱없이 부족했다. 약탈자들이 모두를 정착지에서 몰아낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:587
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " tries to build up the settlement's defenses."
msgstr "은(는) 정착지의 방어를 강화하려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:589
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " quickly makes plans and gets people to help "
msgstr "는 재빨리 계획을 세우고 사람들을 동원해 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:589
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" turn the place into a fortress! The bandits are overwhelmed by the new "
"defenses when they show up, and flee without hurting anyone."
msgstr "와 함께 이곳을 요새로 만든다! 나타난 약탈자들은 새 방어 시설에 압도되어 아무도 다치게 하지 못하고 도망친다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" tells the settlers how to build fortifications in some weak areas. The "
"extra defenses seem to help a lot in the bandit attack! The settlers are "
"thankful for the help!"
msgstr ""
"는 정착민들에게 약한 곳에 방어 시설 짓는 법을 알려 준다. 추가된 방어가 약탈자 습격에 큰 도움이 된 것 같다! 정착민들은 도움에 "
"감사한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:594
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" tries to fortify some things, but the efforts didn't seem to help much "
"against the vicious bandit attack. The wounded settlers accuse "
msgstr "는 이것저것 보강해 보지만 잔혹한 약탈자 습격엔 별 도움이 안 된 것 같다. 다친 정착민들은 비난한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:594
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " of wasting their time, and refuse to give the reward."
msgstr "이(가) 시간만 낭비하게 했다고, 그리고 보상을 거부한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:599
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Bandit Raid Defense"
msgstr "약탈자 습격 방어"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" is asked for help by a settlement. They say they will be raided by bandits "
"soon. If "
msgstr "은(는) 한 정착지로부터 도움을 요청받는다. 곧 약탈자들의 습격이 있을 거라고 한다. 만약 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " helps with the defense, "
msgstr "이(가) 방어를 도우면, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" will get a reward of 15 food, some ammo, and a cowboy rifle!\r\n"
"\tThis could be "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 식량 15, 탄약 약간, 카우보이 소총을 보상으로 받는다!\r\n"
"\t이건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "very dangerous..."
msgstr "매우 위험할 수도 있다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Don't help, drive off"
msgstr "돕지 않고 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Don't help them"
msgstr "돕지 않는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Help them in shootout"
msgstr "총격전을 돕는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:606
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Build up defenses"
msgstr ": 방어를 강화한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": I'll handle it"
msgstr ": 내가 처리할게"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:615
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " spends some time "
msgstr "은(는) 시간을 보낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:615
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "just chillin'"
msgstr "그냥 빈둥대면서"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" gets some impromptu strength exercises in. The heaviest furniture that can "
"be lifted is picked up, then set down. Repeat until "
msgstr "은(는) 즉석 근력 운동을 한다. 들 수 있는 가장 무거운 가구를 들었다 내렸다 한다. 반복, 될 때까지: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "MEGABUFF"
msgstr "근육 괴물"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:625
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" gets some impromptu cardiovascular exercises in. Mostly burpees, some "
"jumping jacks. Repeat until "
msgstr "은(는) 즉석 유산소 운동을 한다. 주로 버피, 가끔 팔 벌려 뛰기. 반복, 될 때까지: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:625
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "ULTRA FIT"
msgstr "초건강"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:630
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:639
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " teaches "
msgstr "은(는) 가르친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:630
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:639
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " what "
msgstr "에게 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:630
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " knows about emergency medical care and semi-painless dentistry."
msgstr "가 아는 응급 의료와 덜 아픈 치과 치료를."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:632
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:641
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " doesn't know much about it! It's a completely useless lesson."
msgstr "는 그에 대해 아는 게 별로 없다! 완전히 쓸모없는 수업이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:639
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" knows about car repair and other ways to accidentally mess up machinery."
msgstr "가 아는 자동차 수리와 실수로 기계를 망가뜨리는 다른 방법들을."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " reveals "
msgstr "은(는) 드러낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " TRUE ESSENCE."
msgstr " 진정한 본질을."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:654
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " gets a rare peaceful moment to relax on an apartment roof."
msgstr "은(는) 아파트 옥상에서 드물게 평화로운 휴식을 즐긴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:657
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:674
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "With no one to bother "
msgstr "방해할 사람이 없으니 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:657
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:674
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " decides to:"
msgstr "는 결정한다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:659
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:676
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:684
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Exercise for strength"
msgstr "근력 운동"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:660
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:677
#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:686
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "Exercise for fitness"
msgstr "체력 운동"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:662
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "There's time to talk, and someone reveals a lot about themself:"
msgstr "이야기할 시간이 생기고, 누군가 자기 이야기를 잔뜩 털어놓는다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid " gets a peaceful moment to rest in a safehouse, no zombies in sight."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 하나 없는 안전 가옥에서 평화롭게 쉰다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:679
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "With some spare time, they decide to:"
msgstr "여유 시간이 생겨서, 이렇게 하기로 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Teach mechanic skills"
msgstr ": 기계 기술 가르치기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:690
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Teach medical skills"
msgstr ": 의술 가르치기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " makes 2 molotov cocktails with 20 gas! Be careful with these!"
msgstr "은(는) 기름 20으로 화염병 2개를 만든다! 조심해서 다뤄!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" makes 4 molotov cocktails with 40 gas! Enough to toast a bunch of zombies!"
msgstr "은(는) 기름 40으로 화염병 4개를 만든다! 좀비 한 무리 구울 만하다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" makes 6 molotov cocktails with 60 gas! This should make a big difference!"
msgstr "은(는) 기름 60으로 화염병 6개를 만든다! 확실히 차이가 날 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " takes 6 empty bottles with "
msgstr "은(는) 빈 병 6개를 챙긴다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ". They might come in handy?"
msgstr ". 쓸모가 있을지도?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Molotov Making"
msgstr "화염병 만들기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" finds a trashed house with some bottles and tattered rags. Searching it "
"seemed like a waste of time, but "
msgstr "은(는) 병과 해진 넝마가 있는 엉망인 집을 발견한다. 뒤지는 건 시간 낭비 같았지만, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " has an idea:"
msgstr "에게 아이디어가 떠오른다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " could make molotovs, if "
msgstr "은(는) 화염병을 만들 수 있다. 만약 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " can spare the gas!"
msgstr "이(가) 기름을 아낄 수 있다면!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " could take the bottles with "
msgstr "은(는) 병을 챙길 수 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ", to throw at zombies and other enemies!"
msgstr ". 좀비나 다른 적에게 던질 용도로!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Sadly, there's not enough gas to spare."
msgstr "안타깝게도 남는 기름이 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Make 2 molotovs - 20 gas"
msgstr "화염병 2개 만들기 - 기름 20"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Make 4 molotovs - 40 gas"
msgstr "화염병 4개 만들기 - 기름 40"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Make 6 molotovs - 60 gas"
msgstr "화염병 6개 만들기 - 기름 60"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Take the bottles"
msgstr "병을 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Leave the house"
msgstr "집을 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " attempts to finish making the bombs."
msgstr "은(는) 폭탄을 마저 만들어 보려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " expertly assembles 6 pipebombs. Afterwards, "
msgstr "는 파이프 폭탄 6개를 능숙하게 조립한다. 그 뒤, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " finds a broken chainsaw and repairs that, too!"
msgstr "은(는) 고장 난 전기톱을 찾아서 그것도 고친다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " easily finishes them, and ends up with 6 pipebombs."
msgstr "는 쉽게 완성해서 파이프 폭탄 6개를 얻는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " manages to not blow "
msgstr "는 운 좋게 날려 버리지 않는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "self up, partially by luck. "
msgstr "자신을. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " ends up with 3 pipebombs, ruining half of them."
msgstr "는 절반을 망치고 파이프 폭탄 3개를 얻는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" isn't comfortable enough with work like this, and makes a mistake. Woops!"
msgstr "는 이런 일에 익숙하지 않아서 실수를 한다. 이런!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Bomber Zombie"
msgstr "폭탄 좀비"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " finds an abandoned safehouse. There's a little bit of ammo inside."
msgstr "은(는) 버려진 안전 가옥을 발견한다. 안에 탄약이 조금 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"On further searching, some unfinished pipebombs are in the building. Someone"
" must have had to leave in a hurry. "
msgstr "더 뒤져 보니 건물 안에 미완성 파이프 폭탄이 있다. 누군가 급히 떠나야 했나 보다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Messing with them could be really dangerous!"
msgstr "건드리면 정말 위험할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Leave them alone!"
msgstr "건드리지 않는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Finish making them"
msgstr ": 마저 만든다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" just ignores the armored man standing in the bridge and crashes right "
"through. "
msgstr "은(는) 다리 위에 선 갑옷 남자를 무시하고 그대로 들이받는다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "THUNK!"
msgstr "쿵!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" charges right at the sports-gear armored man, tackles him at the waist, and"
" tosses him over the bridge. "
msgstr "은(는) 스포츠 장비로 무장한 남자에게 돌진해 허리를 태클하고 다리 밖으로 던져 버린다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "SPLASH!"
msgstr "풍덩!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " gets out the car and tries to push the bridge guard off the bridge."
msgstr "은(는) 차에서 내려 다리 경비를 다리 밖으로 밀어내려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "After some struggling, "
msgstr "한참 씨름한 끝에, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " is able to toss him off the bridge!"
msgstr "은(는) 그를 다리 밖으로 던지는 데 성공한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "It's no use! The armored man just socks "
msgstr "소용없다! 갑옷 남자가 후려친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " with his boxing gloves! "
msgstr "을(를) 권투 글러브로! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " run"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " past him after the beating."
msgstr "얻어맞고 나서 그를 지나쳐 달린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Run him over with car"
msgstr "차로 친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" sprints past the bridge guard! Although the bridge guard tries to follow, "
msgstr "은(는) 다리 경비를 지나쳐 전력 질주한다! 다리 경비가 쫓아오지만, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " is simply too fast."
msgstr "은(는) 너무 빠르다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Later, once the bridge guard is out of breath, "
msgstr "나중에 다리 경비가 숨이 차자, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" runs all the way back to the car and drives across. What a light workout!"
msgstr "은(는) 차까지 돌아가 다리를 건넌다. 가벼운 운동이었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Whilst the bridge guard is distracted, "
msgstr "다리 경비가 한눈파는 사이, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " drives across the bridge. "
msgstr "은(는) 차로 다리를 건넌다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " rejoins them later, after having run several miles."
msgstr "은(는) 몇 킬로미터를 달려서 나중에 합류한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Push him off bridge"
msgstr "다리 밖으로 밀어낸다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Plow through with car"
msgstr "차로 밀고 나간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Fight him one on one!"
msgstr ": 일대일로 붙는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " sprints past him"
msgstr "이(가) 그를 지나쳐 달린다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " walks to the edge of the bridge, turns around, and "
msgstr "은(는) 다리 끝으로 걸어가 뒤돌아서는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "farts"
msgstr "방귀를 뀐다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " in the general direction of the bridge guard."
msgstr ". 대충 다리 경비 쪽으로."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " stands at the edge of the bridge and yells at the bridge guard to "
msgstr "은(는) 다리 끝에 서서 다리 경비에게 소리친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:134
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:241
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:243
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:378
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"The armored man continues staring straight forward. It's not clear if he "
"even heard "
msgstr "갑옷 남자는 계속 정면만 응시한다. 들은 건지조차 모르겠다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Silent Guardian"
msgstr "침묵의 수호자"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"A man in makeshift armor, made from athletic gear, is standing guard in the "
"middle of a narrow wooden bridge on the road. He's wearing boxing gloves, "
"staring forward at the car, silent as he blocks the way past."
msgstr ""
"운동 장비로 만든 임시 갑옷을 입은 남자가 도로 위 좁은 나무다리 한가운데를 지키고 서 있다. 권투 글러브를 끼고 차를 정면으로 노려보며"
" 말없이 길을 막고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Tell sentinel to COOL IT"
msgstr ": 경비에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Instead of being surprised by the ambush, "
msgstr "매복에 놀라는 대신, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" rushes at the man as he's ranting and knocks him out. He doesn't even get "
"time to react."
msgstr "은(는) 고함치는 남자에게 달려들어 기절시킨다. 그는 반응할 틈도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " seizes the opportunity to steal his stuff!"
msgstr "은(는) 기회를 틈타 그의 물건을 훔친다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't acknowledge the ranting man at all. He gets so confused by this that he becomes quiet and wanders off. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 고함치는 남자를 철저히 무시한다. 남자는 너무 어리둥절해서 조용해지더니 어디론가 가 버린다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " wasn't paying attention the whole time, and gets more drawn into "
msgstr "은(는) 내내 딴생각을 하다가 더 깊이 빠져든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " own little world."
msgstr " 작은 세계에."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " interrupts the man's rants by continuously "
msgstr "은(는) 남자의 고함을 끊임없이 끊는다. 방법은: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "FARTING"
msgstr "방귀"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " when he tries to speak."
msgstr ". 그가 말하려 할 때마다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " interrupts the man's rants to tell him to "
msgstr "은(는) 남자의 고함을 끊고 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "SAY IT, DON'T SPRAY IT!"
msgstr "침 튀기지 말고 말해!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Ha! You're alright!"
msgstr "하! 너 괜찮은 놈이구나!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe offers to lend his skills to the team!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그가 일행에 힘을 보태겠다고 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Oh! Looks like we got a heckler!"
msgstr "오! 야유꾼이 있었네!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe blasts "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그가 몰아붙인다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " with a "
msgstr "을(를) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "DEVASTATINGLY INSIGHTFUL RANT!"
msgstr "파괴적으로 통찰력 있는 독설로!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " The butt-blasting rant makes a small shockwave!"
msgstr " 엉덩이를 날려 버리는 독설에 작은 충격파가 인다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" listens to the ranting man and tries to reason with him. The man calms "
"down, and explains that he thought "
msgstr "은(는) 고함치는 남자의 말을 들어 주며 설득해 본다. 남자는 진정하고 착각했다고 설명한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " was a bandit!"
msgstr "이(가) 약탈자인 줄 알았다고!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "the group were bandits!"
msgstr "일행이 약탈자인 줄 알았다고!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " shows him that "
msgstr "은(는) 보여 준다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " bandit"
msgstr "정말 약탈자라는 걸"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:198
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" fights the cantankerous man! It's over very quickly, but he ended up doing "
"some damage before he ran off."
msgstr "은(는) 성질 고약한 남자와 싸운다! 금방 끝나지만, 그가 도망가기 전에 피해를 좀 입혔다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" runs away! The cantankerous man chases them for quite awhile, delivering "
"some "
msgstr "은(는) 도망친다! 성질 고약한 남자가 꽤 오래 쫓아오며 퍼붓는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "SIZZLING RANTS"
msgstr "불꽃 튀는 독설을"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " before "
msgstr ". 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " loses him."
msgstr "이(가) 그를 따돌린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Ranting Man"
msgstr "고함치는 남자"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" is ambushed by a yelling man. He's ranting and raving! He doesn't look "
"particularly dangerous, but those rants are starting to "
msgstr "은(는) 고함치는 남자에게 매복당한다. 그는 열변을 토하며 날뛴다! 그리 위험해 보이진 않지만, 독설이 점점 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "sizzle."
msgstr "불타오르기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Knock him out"
msgstr ": 기절시킨다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": SAY IT, DON'T SPRAY IT"
msgstr ": 침 튀기지 말고 말해"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Ignore him completely"
msgstr ": 완전히 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Listen to him"
msgstr ": 들어 준다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Run away!"
msgstr "도망쳐!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Fight him!"
msgstr "싸운다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "eats"
msgstr "먹어 치운다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "swats"
msgstr "내리친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " the bee! It solves the bee problem, but "
msgstr " 벌을! 벌 문제는 해결됐지만, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " gets stung!"
msgstr "는 벌에 쏘인다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:235
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " sacrifice will never be forgotten!"
msgstr " 희생은 결코 잊히지 않을 것이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " yawns and it kind of sounds like "
msgstr "은(는) 하품을 하는데, 대충 이렇게 들린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " tells the bee to "
msgstr "은(는) 벌에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The bee flies right into "
msgstr "벌이 날아 들어간다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s mouth! "
msgstr "의 입속으로! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " gets stung! "
msgstr "는 쏘인다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "It hurts a lot!"
msgstr "엄청 아프다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " completely ignores the bee! "
msgstr "은(는) 벌을 완전히 무시한다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " somehow didn't notice it. "
msgstr "는 어째선지 벌을 눈치채지 못했다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " follows "
msgstr "은(는) 따른다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " example and also ignore"
msgstr " 본보기를. 그리고 무시한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " the bee."
msgstr " 벌을."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The bee is still buzzing around the car months after it is abandoned."
msgstr "벌은 차가 버려진 지 몇 달이 지나도 여전히 차 안을 윙윙거린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" descends into a panic! The car loses control and then plows into a tree."
msgstr "은(는) 공황에 빠진다! 차가 통제를 잃고 나무에 처박힌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "At some point, the bee escaped through the window."
msgstr "어느새 벌은 창문으로 빠져나갔다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" sings a soothing song to the bee.\r\n"
"\tThe bee flies out of the window.\r\n"
"\tI didn't think I'd ever see the bee leave the car, but it's really happened."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 벌에게 달래는 노래를 불러 준다.\r\n"
"\t벌이 창밖으로 날아간다.\r\n"
"\t벌이 차를 떠나는 걸 볼 날이 올 줄은 몰랐는데, 정말로 일어났다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:270
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " uses "
msgstr "은(는) 발휘한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " lightning fast reflexes to trap the bee in a glass jar."
msgstr " 번개 같은 반사 신경을. 벌을 유리병에 가둔다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "This act is spectacularly cruel and makes even "
msgstr "이건 엄청나게 잔인한 짓이라 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " feel bad."
msgstr "조차 기분이 나쁘다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"The jar becomes the bee's entire world. Even months later, when the lid "
"naturally pops, the bee remains inside. Forever."
msgstr "유리병은 벌의 세계 전부가 된다. 몇 달 뒤 뚜껑이 저절로 열려도, 벌은 안에 남는다. 영원히."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Bee Trouble!"
msgstr "벌 소동!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "A bee keeps harassing "
msgstr "벌 한 마리가 계속 괴롭힌다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\t\tIt takes forever for it to leave. If you only had a car, you would surely have been protected from bees!"
msgstr ""
"을(를)!\r\n"
"\t\t떠나는 데 한참 걸린다. 차만 있었어도 벌로부터 보호받을 수 있었을 텐데!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"A bee flies into the car! Even with a window open, it doesn't leave. It "
"keeps flying right into "
msgstr "벌이 차 안으로 들어왔다! 창문을 열어 둬도 안 나간다. 계속 달려든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s face"
msgstr "의 얼굴로"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\tThis could be the biggest challenge, yet!"
msgstr ""
"!\r\n"
"\t지금까지 중 최대의 난관일지도 모른다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "PANIC!"
msgstr "공황!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " tells bee to COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 벌에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " ignores the bee"
msgstr "은(는) 벌을 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " the bee"
msgstr " 벌을"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " sings bee song"
msgstr "이(가) 벌 노래를 부른다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " captures the bee"
msgstr "이(가) 벌을 잡는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " keeps up a positive attitude!"
msgstr "은(는) 긍정적인 태도를 유지한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " starts talking, to improve the mood."
msgstr "은(는) 분위기를 띄우려고 말을 꺼낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " makes "
msgstr "는 낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " noises. It's a decent enough distraction from the weather!"
msgstr " 소리를. 날씨에서 주의를 돌리기엔 그럭저럭 괜찮다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:321
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:378
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:409
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " tells "
msgstr "은(는) 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:321
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:378
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " to "
msgstr "에게 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "COOL IT. "
msgstr "진정해. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " laughs heartily! This catch phrase never gets old!"
msgstr "은(는) 박장대소한다! 이 유행어는 절대 안 질린다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "This does NOT go over well at all."
msgstr "이건 전혀 안 먹힌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:330
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:557
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " loses "
msgstr "는 잃는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " temper and starts venting about the weather! "
msgstr " 이성을. 그리고 날씨에 대해 울분을 토한다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " feels better but "
msgstr "는 기분이 나아졌지만, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " has to endure the rants."
msgstr "은(는) 그 독설을 견뎌야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " manages to distract "
msgstr "는 주의를 돌리는 데 성공한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " from the crappy weather!"
msgstr "의 관심을 구린 날씨에서!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" whines and whines, both about the weather and other non-related topics."
msgstr "는 날씨와 상관없는 주제까지 섞어 가며 징징대고 또 징징댄다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:340
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "It doesn't help that much."
msgstr "별로 도움이 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:345
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Gloomy Weather Trip"
msgstr "우울한 날씨 속 여행"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The weather is gray and dingy and it's really getting "
msgstr "날씨가 잿빛에 칙칙해서 정말 우울하게 만든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " down. "
msgstr ". "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " has no one to complain about the weather to."
msgstr "는 날씨에 대해 불평할 상대가 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Someone decides to speak up, to help the mood:"
msgstr "누군가 분위기를 띄우려 말을 꺼낸다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " is blamed for the fart."
msgstr "이(가) 방귀의 범인으로 지목된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Wow! What a bad "
msgstr "와! 정말 나쁜 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:367
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " shrugs in a good-natured way."
msgstr "는 너그럽게 어깨를 으쓱한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The smell lingers!"
msgstr "냄새가 가시지 않는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Was this the real culprit? Who can say..."
msgstr "진짜 범인이었을까? 누가 알겠는가..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:375
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " emits a "
msgstr "은(는) 뀐다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:375
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "VERY CLEAR SECOND FART."
msgstr "아주 확실한 두 번째 방귀를."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Mystery solved!"
msgstr "수수께끼 해결!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "BEADS OF NERVOUS SWEAT"
msgstr "초조한 식은땀"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " roll down "
msgstr "이 흘러내린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s face. Yet nothing can be proven!"
msgstr "의 얼굴을. 하지만 증거는 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" explains a complicated sequence of deduction that arrives at one "
"conclusion:"
msgstr "은(는) 복잡한 추리 끝에 하나의 결론에 이른다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The fart was made by a "
msgstr "방귀를 뀐 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "GHOST!!! WWWWHHHHOAAAAAAAAA!"
msgstr "유령이다!!! 우우우우우오오오오오!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "It was "
msgstr "방귀를 뀐 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " who was the farter!"
msgstr "였다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "In secret, it was actually "
msgstr "사실 몰래 뀐 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " who was the "
msgstr "였다. 정체는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "fart monster!"
msgstr "방귀 괴물!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The Mystery of the Ghost Fart"
msgstr "유령 방귀 미스터리"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "It's just another day on the Death Road when someone "
msgstr "데스 로드의 평범한 하루, 누군가 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "farts in the car."
msgstr "차 안에서 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:401
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Who could have done this? We may never, ever know."
msgstr "누가 이런 짓을? 영원히, 절대 알 수 없을 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:404
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Who could have done this? It was probably "
msgstr "누가 이런 짓을? 아마 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:404
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ". What a bad "
msgstr "일 것이다. 정말 나쁜 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"Drama and mystery consume the team.\r\n"
"\t\tPick someone to blame:"
msgstr ""
"드라마와 미스터리가 일행을 집어삼킨다.\r\n"
"\t\t탓할 사람을 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:409
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " to COOL IT"
msgstr "에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " solves the mystery"
msgstr "이(가) 수수께끼를 푼다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:421
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " manages to hotwire the car!"
msgstr "은(는) 직결로 시동 거는 데 성공한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:423
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Without a good mechanic, there's no other way for "
msgstr "좋은 정비공이 없으니 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:423
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " to start the car!"
msgstr "이(가) 시동을 걸 다른 방법이 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:429
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " wrestles the gator for the keys!"
msgstr "은(는) 열쇠를 걸고 악어와 씨름한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:431
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The gator is bested by "
msgstr "악어가 당해 낼 수 없다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:431
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s raw strength! It spits out the keys."
msgstr "의 순수한 힘을! 악어가 열쇠를 뱉는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:433
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The gator wins and ends up taking a huge chomp out of "
msgstr "악어가 이기고 크게 한 입 물어뜯는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:433
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "! It drops the keys."
msgstr "을(를)! 그러고는 열쇠를 떨군다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:438
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" pesters the gator by chasing it and running from it, in hopes it drops the "
"keys."
msgstr "은(는) 악어를 쫓아다니다 도망치다 하면서 열쇠를 떨구길 바라며 귀찮게 군다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:440
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The gator is tired out by "
msgstr "악어가 지친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:440
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s energy! The keys eventually slip out of its mouth."
msgstr "의 에너지에! 결국 열쇠가 입에서 미끄러져 나온다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:442
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The gator lunges in and chomps "
msgstr "악어가 달려들어 문다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:442
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " when "
msgstr "을(를). "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:442
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " gets tired! The gator drops the keys."
msgstr "가 지친 틈에! 악어가 열쇠를 떨군다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:447
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " shoots at the gator!"
msgstr "은(는) 악어를 쏜다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The gator is blasted by "
msgstr "악어가 맞는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s good aiming! It drops the car keys."
msgstr "의 정확한 조준에! 차 열쇠를 떨군다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " whiffs the shot. The gator swallows the keys and waddles away."
msgstr "은(는) 빗맞힌다. 악어가 열쇠를 삼키고 뒤뚱뒤뚱 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:458
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" just goes ahead and grabs the car keys right from the gator's mouth! No problem!\r\n"
"\tThe gator wasn't expecting this casual action at all. It is so surprised that it didn't snap its jaws shut. "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 그냥 악어 입에서 차 열쇠를 꺼낸다! 문제없다!\r\n"
"\t악어는 이렇게 태연한 행동을 전혀 예상하지 못했다. 너무 놀라서 입을 다물지도 못했다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " drives the car away!"
msgstr "은(는) 차를 몰고 떠난다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:464
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" decides that the car keys aren't worth messing with an extremely dangerous alligator.\r\n"
"\tThe alligator is sad that his strategy doesn't work, and loses a point of morale."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차 열쇠 때문에 극도로 위험한 악어와 엮일 가치는 없다고 판단한다.\r\n"
"\t악어는 작전이 안 통해서 슬퍼하며 사기가 1 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:470
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Misplaced Keys"
msgstr "잃어버린 열쇠"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " can't find the car keys! After awhile, "
msgstr "은(는) 차 열쇠를 못 찾는다! 한참 뒤, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " spot"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " the keys laying inside a "
msgstr "열쇠를 발견한다. 위치는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "gator's open mouth"
msgstr "악어의 벌린 입 속"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tAfter most humans disappeared, alligators started spreading across the entire east coast. It's rumored the gators may eat zombies and car keys."
msgstr ""
".\r\n"
"\t인간이 대부분 사라진 뒤 악어들이 동부 해안 전역으로 퍼졌다. 소문엔 악어가 좀비와 차 열쇠를 먹는다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " wrestles the gator"
msgstr "이(가) 악어와 씨름한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:474
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " tires out the gator"
msgstr "이(가) 악어를 지치게 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " just grabs the keys"
msgstr "이(가) 그냥 열쇠를 집는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:479
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " shoots the gator"
msgstr "이(가) 악어를 쏜다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:481
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Abandon the car keys"
msgstr "차 열쇠를 포기한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:489
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " starts scavenging through the town, avoiding traps to the best of "
msgstr "은(는) 마을을 뒤지기 시작한다. 함정을 최대한 피하면서: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:489
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " ability."
msgstr " 능력껏."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " deduces where many traps are based on the environment alone. "
msgstr "는 주변 환경만 보고 함정 위치를 대부분 추리해 낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" is able to avoid injury and deconstruct some of the traps for later use!"
msgstr "은(는) 부상을 피하고, 함정 일부를 해체해서 나중에 쓰려고 챙긴다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:492
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "GOT LANDMINES!"
msgstr "지뢰 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:496
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" is extremely paranoid about every step and action. It's slow going, many "
"traps go off. "
msgstr "는 한 걸음, 한 동작마다 극도로 편집증적이다. 진행은 느리고 함정이 많이 터진다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:496
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " is ready for every one of them, and avoids injury."
msgstr "은(는) 그 모든 함정에 대비하고 있어서 부상을 피한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " blunders right through. Most of the traps hit "
msgstr "는 그냥 막무가내로 돌진한다. 함정 대부분이 덮친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " somehow survives this long process!"
msgstr "은(는) 어떻게든 이 긴 과정을 살아서 버틴다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Seeing so many traps in action was educational!"
msgstr "함정이 작동하는 걸 이렇게 많이 보니 공부가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " is careful about where "
msgstr "는 조심한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "'s going. Many traps are spotted and set off safely. "
msgstr "가 어디로 가는지. 많은 함정을 발견하고 안전하게 터뜨린다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " avoids injury!"
msgstr "은(는) 부상을 피한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " experience with mechanical stuff to reason out where "
msgstr " 기계 경험을 살려 추론한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " would put traps if "
msgstr "라면 함정을 어디에 둘지. 만약 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " was some kind of nut. "
msgstr "가 미친놈이라면. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " avoids or disarms many traps this way!"
msgstr "은(는) 이렇게 많은 함정을 피하거나 해체한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " ability at avoiding traps isn't that great. "
msgstr " 함정 회피 능력은 별로다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " gets shredded bad! "
msgstr "은(는) 처참하게 너덜너덜해진다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:515
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Who should scout the booby trapped town?"
msgstr "누가 함정 마을을 정찰할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:520
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Town of Traps"
msgstr "함정 마을"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:521
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" finds a street in a town that has traps all over it. Pits with blankets put"
" over the top. Snares everywhere. Spikes on barrels. A door with an obvious "
"guillotine over it. And these are just the visible ones."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 함정이 가득한 마을 거리를 발견한다. 담요로 덮은 구덩이. 사방에 올가미. 통에 박힌 가시. 단두대가 뻔히 매달린 문. 그것도 "
"눈에 보이는 것만."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Scouting this area for loot could be "
msgstr "이 지역에서 물자를 찾는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "very dangerous"
msgstr "매우 위험할 수 있다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ", especially since "
msgstr ". 특히 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " is alone!"
msgstr "은(는) 혼자니까!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:524
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " tries exploring"
msgstr "이(가) 탐색해 본다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:526
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Send a scout to explore for loot?"
msgstr "정찰병을 보내 물자를 찾을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:529
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:534
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Drive away!"
msgstr "떠난다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:541
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:562
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " enters the dark and creepy store."
msgstr "은(는) 어둡고 으스스한 가게에 들어간다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:543
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " usual sense of paranoia backfires! "
msgstr " 평소의 편집증이 역효과를 낸다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:543
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " gets super scared. "
msgstr "는 잔뜩 겁을 먹는다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:543
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " sees a tiny mouse and then starts "
msgstr "은(는) 작은 생쥐를 보고 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:543
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "shrieking like a Youtuber"
msgstr "유튜버처럼 비명 지르기를"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:546
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" darts around the store at blistering speed, dodging skeletons, pumpkins and"
" a storage heater that was in the way for some reason. Even though the store"
" is small, "
msgstr "는 번개 같은 속도로 가게를 누비며 해골, 호박, 어째선지 길을 막고 있던 전기 히터를 피한다. 가게가 작은데도, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:546
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " looks out of breath when they re-emerge from it."
msgstr "은(는) 다시 나올 때 숨이 차 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " doesn't notice anything scary in there. Not even when a "
msgstr "는 안에서 무서운 걸 하나도 못 느낀다. 심지어 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "SPOOKY DANCING SKELETON"
msgstr "으스스하게 춤추는 해골"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " drops from the ceiling and starts clattering around!"
msgstr "이(가) 천장에서 떨어져 달그락거려도!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " keeps calm, takes the loot "
msgstr "는 침착하게 물자를 챙긴다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " finds, and gets out of there!"
msgstr "가 찾은 물자를. 그리고 빠져나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:557
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " calm and runs out of there, claiming there was no loot!"
msgstr " 침착함을. 그리고 뛰쳐나와서 물자가 없었다고 우긴다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:564
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " mistakes a mannequin for a zombie and attacks! This makes "
msgstr "은(는) 마네킹을 좀비로 착각하고 공격한다! 그 바람에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:564
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" freak out and also start attacking blindy. In the end, no mannequins were "
"left standing."
msgstr "도 기겁해서 덩달아 마구 공격한다. 결국 서 있는 마네킹은 하나도 남지 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:567
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Everyone keeps fairly calm! The store is looted without incident."
msgstr "모두 꽤 침착하다! 가게를 무사히 털었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Who should enter the creepy store?"
msgstr "누가 으스스한 가게에 들어갈까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:577
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Dark and Creepy Store"
msgstr "어둡고 으스스한 가게"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" finds a waterlogged store. There's a lot of mannequins inside, barely visible in the darkness. The whole store is especially creepy.\r\n"
"\tThere may be some moldy supplies left in there."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 물에 잠긴 가게를 발견한다. 어둠 속에 마네킹이 잔뜩 희미하게 보인다. 가게 전체가 유난히 으스스하다.\r\n"
"\t곰팡이 핀 물자가 좀 남아 있을지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:580
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Ignore this place"
msgstr "여긴 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " goes in the store"
msgstr "이(가) 가게에 들어간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:584
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Send someone in"
msgstr "한 명을 들여보낸다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:585
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Send everyone in!"
msgstr "모두 들여보낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:593
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " throws caution to the wind and decides to keep on driving."
msgstr "은(는) 신중함은 내던지고 계속 달리기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:595
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " strains "
msgstr "은(는) 부릅뜬다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:595
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " eyes and manages to narrowly avoid crashing into anything!"
msgstr " 눈을. 그리고 가까스로 충돌을 피한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"The car rams through some unseen obstacles in the rain. Some of its armor "
"ends up falling off."
msgstr "빗속에서 보이지 않는 장애물을 들이받는다. 장갑 일부가 떨어져 나간다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The car gets damaged plowing through some wreckage "
msgstr "차가 잔해를 뚫고 지나가며 손상을 입는다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " didn't see in time, but it's still running."
msgstr "이(가) 제때 못 봤지만, 차는 아직 굴러간다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"The car plows right into the side of a ruined car in the road, and gets "
"wrecked. "
msgstr "차가 도로 위의 폐차 옆구리를 그대로 들이받아 박살 난다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " starts walking."
msgstr "은(는) 걷기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:612
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't even get settled in to this house before they realize a large horde"
" is closing in from the pouring rain."
msgstr "은(는) 집에 자리를 잡기도 전에, 쏟아지는 빗속에서 큰 무리가 다가오고 있다는 걸 깨닫는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:615
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:643
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Try to Survive"
msgstr "살아남아라"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:619
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" takes the less busy side road and finds a place to camp until the weather "
"clears."
msgstr "은(는) 덜 붐비는 샛길로 가서 날씨가 갤 때까지 야영할 곳을 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"It takes an extra day for the weather to improve enough to continue the "
"journey. "
msgstr "여정을 계속할 만큼 날씨가 좋아지는 데 하루가 더 걸린다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:625
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Driving in Bad Weather"
msgstr "악천후 속 운전"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"Rain starts pouring down. It's hard to see, and the shapes of zombies lurk "
"right on the edge of the darkness. "
msgstr "비가 쏟아지기 시작한다. 앞이 잘 안 보이고, 어둠의 가장자리에 좀비 형체가 어른거린다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " isn't sure what would be worse: continuing, or stopping here."
msgstr "은(는) 계속 가는 게 나쁠지, 여기 멈추는 게 나쁠지 모르겠다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Keep Driving"
msgstr "계속 달린다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:629
#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:650
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Seek shelter in house"
msgstr "집에 피신한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Go down side road, camp"
msgstr "샛길로 가서 야영한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:636
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " decides to try to try to drive through the horde!"
msgstr "은(는) 무리를 뚫고 달려 보기로 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:640
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" hides in a nearby house to wait for the horde to disperse. The zombies end "
"up becoming agitated and they attack!"
msgstr "은(는) 무리가 흩어지길 기다리며 근처 집에 숨는다. 좀비들이 흥분해서 공격해 온다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:647
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Heavy Traffic"
msgstr "교통 체증"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:649
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "There's a large horde of zombies on the road ahead. "
msgstr "앞쪽 도로에 큰 좀비 무리가 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:649
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " isn't sure if "
msgstr "은(는) 확신이 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:649
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " could get through them or not."
msgstr "이(가) 뚫고 지나갈 수 있을지."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:652
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Take a detour"
msgstr "우회한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:653
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "Plow through!"
msgstr "밀고 나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Weegee Board [tm]"
msgstr "위지 보드 [tm]"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " now feels incredibly unlucky. Beware the "
msgstr "은(는) 이제 엄청나게 운이 나빠진 기분이다. 조심해라: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:22
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Curse of Weegee!"
msgstr "위지의 저주!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "LUCK MASSIVELY DECREASED!"
msgstr "행운 대폭 감소!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "Somewhere in the distance, a goblin laughs."
msgstr "저 멀리서 고블린이 웃는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:30
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:39
#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "The "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " spells out that "
msgstr "이(가) 철자를 짚는다. "
